arish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Franklin Parish runs 75 years, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025, November to December finished at 38% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 35% and May to June at 167% on the middle. Grid 14854 had its driest year in 2010 at 57%.</p>"}
